# Claude Code agent worktrees — transient; never commit as gitlinks
.claude/worktrees/

# graphify: keep graph.json / manifest.json (the data artifacts, tracked by
# convention) and ignore everything the tool regenerates from them.
#
# graphify-out/cache/ is why this block matters. It is 1,103 content-addressed
# AST files, 15MB, keyed by the SHA-256 of the source file each was parsed from
# and rewritten on every run — worthless in a checkout, since any other machine
# regenerates it from its own working tree. Untracked, it made the editor's SCM
# badge read "1K+" and buried the pending work that was actually real.
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/.graphify_root
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/.graphify_labels.json
graphify-out/.graphify_analysis.json
graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
graphify-out/graph.html
